      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "JOHN WAYNE NZ (1) drew wide last start and was easily accounted for, beaten 13 metres into 11th at Albion Park over 2138m. Has the benefit of a far better draw, finds a suitable assignment and can turn things around. MISTER SEASIDE (2) turned in a much better run at his latest appearance when he scored by 2.25 metres over 2040m at this track. Will enjoy a nice run from this favourable starting position. Won't find this any harder and he can make it consecutive wins. HEZ DUSTY (5) didn't do a bad job when sixth over 1660m at Albion Park last time out. COMMODORE JUJON (7) is worth some thought despite his last-start sixth over 1780m at this track on August 5.",
